        <abstract>
            <para>This is a multi-year dataset collected by Keng-Lou James Hung and Jessica Mullins in San Diego County as a part of research in Dr. David Holway&amp;#39;s lab between 2011 and 2024. These projects assess various aspects of how land-use type and climate change impact native bee assemblages</para>
